		"description": "<p>Also starting at 1st level, you can use a bonus action to choose a number of creatures equal to your proficiency bonus within 30 feet of you. If the targets can hear or see you, <strong>they regain hit points equal to 1d8 + twice your Charisma modifier.</strong> Once you have used this ability, you cannot use it again until you complete a long rest.</p><p>You can simultaneously target 2 allies with this feature at 3rd level. Starting at 7th level, you regain use of this feature after finishing a short or a long rest.</p><p><strong>Additionally, the healing die of this ability increases to 1d10 at 12th level.</strong></p>",
